OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud thick
OL,6,Fenough for a few showers this evening,
OL,7,Fthen rain moves in from the west.
OL,8,FMostly light but turning showery into
OL,9,Fthe early hours with a few showers
OL,10,Fpersisting till dawn. Feeling fresher
OL,11,Fand less humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FThe odd isolated, possibly
OL,14,Fheavy, shower remains through the day,
OL,15,Fbut most places staying dry with sunny
OL,16,Fspells. Temperatures around, or just
OL,17,Fbelow average for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
